    lines+=['', 'The real mainnet mint receipt was then proved with its Ethereum receipt MPT branch and a governed checkpoint certificate containing six independently reproduced validator votes. The issuer destination-consume operation passed native execution and all six accepted receipts. Validator private keys stayed on their hosts. This closes the native pending-claim accounting; mainnet acceptance alone was not used as a substitute.', '', f"Final read-back at Ethereum block **{block}**, native **h{s['tip']['height']}**: **1.000000 wB24** supply, all held by the dedicated operator; native Ethereum inventory **1.000000**, pending claims **0**, conservation invariant passing. Native authorized supply **{r['authorized_valid_supply_atoms']/1e6:.6f} B24**, funded F reserve **{r['settlement_reserve_atoms']/1e6:.6f}**, aggregate non-NAV spread **{r['v2']['non_nav_spread_atoms']/1e6:.6f}**. Minting was re-paused after the test; **mintPaused=true**, **returnPaused=true**, controller locked, owner/governance unchanged. Pool remains initialized with **zero liquidity**. No live USDC approval/deposit or LP seed occurred.", '', f"All Phase-6 mainnet transactions spent **{result['gas_used']:,} gas / {Decimal(result['gas_spent_wei'])/Decimal(10**18)} ETH**. Operator balance is **{Decimal(eth)/Decimal(10**18)} ETH**, **{usdc/1e6:.6f} USDC**, nonce **{result['operator_nonce']}**. Future proof/mint/re-pause, deposit, approvals and LP budget: **{budget:,} gas**, including measured paths, their existing margins and another 10% aggregate margin; current max fee **{fee/1e9:.6f} gwei**, maximum **{Decimal(budget*fee)/Decimal(10**18)} ETH**. Remaining ETH covers it: **{remaining_covered}**. Refresh at launch; the 5000-unit proof gas may differ slightly from the one-unit measured path.", '', 'The refreshed exact unfunded sequence is `evidence/tee/phase6/funding-final/sequence.json`, with unsigned bridge calldata, bridge-job template and native operations. The prepared LP template is `lp-qualification/unsigned-LP-template.json`; refresh NAV/price, token amounts, deadlines, nonces and code pins before signing. The 1-wB24 test inventory is separate from the future 5000-wB24 LP allotment.', '', '**Remaining gaps:** the actual 5025-USDC deposit to Alice, corresponding real claim/cap growth, 5000-B24 subscription/export/proof/mint and 2000-USDC + 5000-wB24 LP have not run because that funding sequence is preparation-only. Their pieces are qualified as described, and the real small export now closes the V2 archive/proof/accept/mint/ack gap, but the full 7025-USDC launch is not complete. Requote if NAV changes; 5025 only buys 5000 at NAV 1. ReturnBurnedV3 remains unsupported by release 4, so returns stay paused. General order-book buyers still cannot use legacy route cash-in; this phase changes no validator consensus or wallet UI.', '', 'Final evidence: `phase6-result.json`, `b24-mainnet-handover.json`, `real-export/`, `real-receipt-proof/`, `mint-qualification/`, `mainnet-small-mint/`, `destination-ack/`, `funding-final/`, and the final publication/evidence index in `evidence/tee/phase6/`.']
